bels":["in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":29,"upvotes":6},"date":"2022-12-03T22:49:47+02:00","creationDate":"2022-12-03T22:48:36+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/db94e056-734b-11ed-a9fe-fa163e99870e\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/db94e056-734b-11ed-a9fe-fa163e99870e\/reports"}}},{"id":"a8bb8792-7310-11ed-ad03-fa163e9aa6fa","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"The best survival game i've ever played.","description":"Project Zomboid is a true indie game, and you can feel it in its every aspect; its a game that can give you hundreds of hours of entertainment. Although it has been in developing for a decade, and still is, the game is fully playable to the point that you won't need any other game to sink hours if you like it.\n\nSo not only you can already play it for hours, but there is the certainty that is gonna get better with further development, as the devs insert even more content into it.\n\nBest thing of the game for me is the customization: you can modify the game settings, you can configure your own game as you like: fast\/slow walkers; supplies; spawns; weather; everything. There is no wrong way to play the game, you can make it as you like it to be. That also gives you a lot of flavour, since you can make one game completely different from another. You can play pure survival with no zombies; walking dead settings; 28-days settings. Whatever you desire.\n\n\nTragically the customization dies here with GoG. There are no mods you can use. Its not that you will need them, because you wont. But if you wanna go one more step, you cant. Unless you get it on Steam, since the modding community has settled there (there's no Nexus nor ModDB for this im afraid). So if you like modding or using mods in general i recommend Steam over Gog, sadly.\n\n\nIn summary: if you got as far as to read this, its a no brainer. Buy the game and enjoy.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988554737545595","username":"Astrain","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/7adfaad3df654d5babc095dbd755d2e6e1b58977cc3427acb1dc2545029c82fc_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":53,"reviews":1}},"labels":[],"votes":{"downvotes":4,"upvotes":7},"date":"2022-12-03T15:44:50+02:00","creationDate":"2022-12-03T15:44:50+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/a8bb8792-7310-11ed-ad03-fa163e9aa6fa\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/a8bb8792-7310-11ed-ad03-fa163e9aa6fa\/reports"}}},{"id":"87d81b36-6ffe-11ed-9805-fa163e99870e","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":4},"content":{"title":"A Zombie Sandbox Like No Other","description":"This might be an \"early access\" title, but it's easily a full game, and one that is more in-depth than just about any other zombie experience on the market. \n\nI'll get the bad out of the way first. I want NPCs. Just basic survivors that solo players can recruit on their own (or dispose of if so inclined), and kind of build up a little community. it doesn't need to become a world builder or anything, but just some stuff to help with the loneliness of it outside of playing online would be great. Heck, give us pets, while you're at it so we can get the I am Legend experience.\n\nOther than that, I absolutely adore it. \n\nGraphics: The isometric perspective and simple, yet effective, graphics are charming, and the amount of detail put into the environments really makes the game world come to life. It won't satisfy people who need 4K garlic bulbs in the latest AAA hit, but that isn't a bad thing.\n\nGameplay: The gamplay is exceptional, and it's what surprises me the most. It's so in-depth, and every little detail is thought out. Firearms are a good example of this. You don't slip a randomly loaded mag into your gun and get it done. You have to open the box of ammo, fill the magazine you (hopefully) have in your inventory, insert that into it, and then rack it. That goes for simply pressing the reload button too, but without all the menu clicking. Death is permanent, but you can make a new character in the same persistent world; so, you might just bump into all those beginner characters you lost in your first two hours of play assuming they were bitten before death. lol. \n\nI can go on for hours, but I won't. A lot of fun is found in learning the mechanics and dying because you didn't think to disinfect a wound before bandaging or actually bait a trap you needed food from. \n\nPerformance:\n\nThis is great. I haven't had slowdowns or frame drops. No glitches or crashes. My fans kick on in high-pop areas. \n\nYou can also mod it very easily, and the devs encourage it. \n\n\n\n\n","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"54333852889397357","username":"nikolaskeel93","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/40dfa99cc435607a35b61c3287180110e522e46b2a2e2ad05c84cd15c1e186b7_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_bi