t":{"title":"A mile deep, but an inch wide","description":"This is an absolutely superb simulation of surviving - and ultimately not surviving - the zombie apocalypse.  The level of detail is simply mind blowing, up there with Rimworld or Dwarf Fortress. In its current form, the game delivers much of what was promised, and the modding community has produced the rest.\n\nIt's one of those games where you'll create emergent narratives around the mechanics: you'll really feel it each time your hours (or dozen of hours or hundreds of hours) of development all ends in one tragic bite, or a bad bit of fish.\n\nSounds great, right?  Well, yes, but there's a fundamental problem: each playthrough is largely the same.\n\nFirst, three days of watching TV, looking for books and basic tools, and disassembling furniture.\n\nThen you'll grab any car, drive to one of the wells, plant cabbages, forage for sticks and stones, build walls, and take the battery, radio and bulbs in and out of your ride every morning.\n\nYou CAN do other things, but they're all worse choices and will end your game faster.  And each game will end, and you'll be starting over and doing the exact same things over and over again.\n\nYes, there are some scenarios, a plethora of sandbox options, and playing with different abilities and particularly disabilities can alter the challenge. But essentially there's only one really effective strategy whatever the mode, and eventually you'll simply lose the will to start over and do it all yet again.  Your experience OF the game will eventually mirror your experience IN the game.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988305919239974","username":"Rogerborg","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":19,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":4,"upvotes":36},"date":"2022-06-12T20:54:46+03:00","creationDate":"2022-06-12T20:54:46+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/bf49a03c-ea78-11ec-abde-42010a340c25\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/bf49a03c-ea78-11ec-abde-42010a340c25\/reports"}}},{"id":"ce404a3a-e458-11ec-8bc4-42010a340c25","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Przyk\u0142ad \u017ce grafika to nie wszystko","description":"Pocz\u0105tkowo odra\u017ca\u0142a mnie oprawa wizualna, ale zastosowane w niej mechaniki zdecydowanie to nadrabiaj\u0105. Przy pierwszym kontakcie z produkcj\u0105 mia\u0142em wra\u017cenie \u017ce gram w moda do pierwszej cz\u0119\u015bci The Sims, lecz ogrom mo\u017cliwo\u015bci kt\u00f3re zaskakuj\u0105 z ka\u017cd\u0105 minut\u0105 sp\u0119dzon\u0105 przy Zomboid szybko z tego wra\u017cenia wyprowadzaj\u0105. \n\nZaczn\u0119 od minus\u00f3w bo jest ich najmniej w mojej ocenie:\n- Grafika\n- Stabilno\u015b\u0107 publicznych serwer\u00f3w przekraczaj\u0105cych 32 graczy\n- Brak rozbudowanego w\u0105tku fabularnego (praktycznie pozostaje do dyspozycji tylko piaskownica)\n\nPozytywy:\n\n- Rozbudowany system potrzeb (g\u0142\u00f3d, pragnienie, stan psychiczny, odpoczynek, sen, temperatura cia\u0142a, pot)\n- Realistyczny ud\u017awig i jego niewielka redukcja w przypadku dodatkowych plecak\u00f3w czy saszetek\n- Wp\u0142yw spo\u017cywanej \u017cywno\u015bci na osi\u0105galn\u0105 mas\u0119 cia\u0142a oraz \u0107wiczenia poprawiaj\u0105ce kondycje i si\u0142\u0119\n- Wbudowany czat g\u0142osowy, kt\u00f3ry s\u0142ysz\u0105 nie tylko inni gracze ale i okoliczni zombie\n- Udzielanie pierwszej pomocy przy pomocy potarganych ubra\u0144, banda\u017cy nie wystarcz\u0105 bo w grze istnieje r\u00f3wnie\u017c dezynfekcja ran i opatrunk\u00f3w, kt\u00f3re wraz z rodzajem rany trzeba regularnie zmienia\u0107\n- Satysfakcjonuj\u0105cy system tworzenia przedmiot\u00f3w i obiekt\u00f3w\n- Pojazdy (wliczaj\u0105c wszelkie mo\u017cliwo\u015bci naprawy z odpowiednimi cz\u0119\u015bciami i narz\u0119dziami)\n- Logicznie ustalone regu\u0142y zuu\u017cywania przedmiot\u00f3w (walka, a rozmontowywanie maj\u0105 inny wp\u0142yw na zuu\u017cycie narz\u0119dzi)\n- Mo\u017cliwo\u015b\u0107 tworzenia w\u0142asnej gry wieloosobowej lokalnie, w sieci lub w trybie (split-screen) po pod\u0142\u0105czeniu kontrolera.\n- Dost\u0119pno\u015b\u0107 wielu modyfikacji poszerzaj\u0105cych mo\u017cliwo\u015bci produkcji\n- I wiele wi\u0119cej\n\nPodsumowuj\u0105c licz\u0119 \u017ce deweloperzy i moderzy b\u0119d\u0105 dalej rozwija\u0107 ten tytu\u0142 i lekko licz\u0119 na jakie\u015b usprawnienia graficzne wprowadzaj\u0105ce lepszy klimat odczuwalny podczas rozgrywki. \nGra\u0142em w wiele tytu\u0142\u00f3w z motywem zombie, ale ma\u0142o kt\u00f3ry wprowadza\u0142 tak realistyczn\u0105 rozgrywk\u0119 w \u015bwiecie apokalipsy zombie, a najbli\u017cej jest wg. mnie Stay of Decay 2, kt\u00f3ry mimo wszystko odbiega mo\u017cliwo\u015bciami od Zomboida.","language":"pl-PL"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988852426652384","username":"Shagans","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/ccc03b5c023f113fcb7e57460942b0a7bac302cb7fc2cced30b5a4ea5e98bc98_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":771,"reviews":38}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":0,"upvotes":6},"date":"2022-06-05T02:15:18+03:00","creationDate":"2022-06-05T01:51:01+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/ce404a3a-e458-11ec-8bc4-42010a340c25\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/ce404a3a-e458-11ec-8bc4-42010a340c25\/reports"}}},{"id":"bccc8f42-df3b-11ec-8811-fa163e9aa6fa","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":2},"content":{"title":"Frank N Beans","description":"Given this is hard to pin down I opted for a non-sense title but perhaps it will make sense by the time you've read this.\n\nNormally I'd think I'd like this game which has a \"duh\" factor to why I bought it. Having played it for a while I can say, I don't think I do like it for an array of reasons that go from personal preference to technical (but not really to do with Early Access issues).\n\nSo the first thing to note is depending on where you buy the game you may get \"less game.\" Basically mods won't be available to you because \"freedom\" or something. Sadly I've come across a lot of games lately with various features where depending on your platform or place of purchase you get \"less\" due to this \"modder freedom to choose\" various things.\n\nNext up are the controls. This game has a strange twin stick shooter set up without being a twin stick shooter. Given I hate twin stick shooters that doesn't help but it's kinda worse. The controls are really clunky and frustrating. This isn't really an EA issue where they will \"work it out\" over time but rather this is just how it's designed. Now this could change of course but it seems like this is just how it is. The twin stick thing combined with the iso view can really create some odd issues. No matter what perks you have or how tricked out your character is every character feels like some bumbling fool in a movie about a bumbling fool.\n\nPast the input issues is just how the game plays out. It's taken something that we're into as an exciting scenario and turned it into a dull chore. Between doing laundry because you got some dead rat on your shirt and or getting swarmed because your character did the wrong action (go through the window, nope I'ma close it then stand here like an idiot so they can bite me) the game feels like a baby sitting simulator. Oh my character is crying...cue things you do to stop a baby from crying.\n\nBottom line is the game just feels dull. No excitement, no adventure, not even bleak doom.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"50224868644187786","username":"nPHYN1T3","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"h