/reports"}}},{"id":"9b6ab158-d3bf-11ec-abf7-fa163e99870e","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":1},"content":{"title":"A Game of Widows","description":"I went through the tutorial and instantly died when I went into a game. Why? Because in the tutorial they tell you nothing on how to craft and make things like bandages from clothing. Such a thing like this in a game is base line useage of the UI which should be at least explained in a basic example. The problem with a game like this is because there is so much to take care of they need to cover the basics of it in the tutorial but they only cover combat. This game is not just about combat and this needs to be reflected in the tutorial. If not this is the type of game that you will have to research before you even play or you will eventually loose your character to some stupid issue of some unknown mechanic. So much of this game is just figuring out the system of windows and interactions you can do with them that it should have been put into the tutorial to save time and frustration.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"55196963913497022","username":"Syntur","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5