 ver c\u00f3mo sobrevives sin herramientas.\n.- Que quieres fortificar una casa y quedarte encerrado: suerte al buscar comida.\n\nVamos, que por el  precio que tiene y por el contenido que llevan a\u00f1os actualizando merece mucho la pena. Y eso sin hablar de los mods que puedes insertar que le dan otra perspectiva totalmente diferente.","language":"es"},"reviewer":{"id":"54000964949766866","username":"aeoris2000","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457