/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/3950ecba-5b35-11ec-8591-fa163e99870e\/reports"}}},{"id":"b29b1d7c-37ca-11ec-931a-fa163e99870e","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":2},"content":{"title":"loved the idea,","description":"but just not fun. The game tries to be realistic, but if i want a real zombie survival game, i play real life.\nIf your life is too happy for some reason and you like to suffer in a game - this is for you.\n\nThe game tries to be a simulation so much it stops being a game for me.\n\n2 stars for more or less solid engine and innovative user interface. the community also is one of those \"hardcore\" echochambers, in which you are only allowed to have specific oppinions.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"47097089612818414","username":"y5egrim","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/b22b5e1aa66ce2027d57e140e28bc5c088c28b3ad523aa8108a0b842f1264003_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":123,"reviews":15}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":27,"upvotes":22},"date":"2021-10-28T11:40:26+03:00","creationDate":"2021-10-28T11:40:26+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/b29b1d7c-37ca-11ec-931a-fa163e99870e\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/b29b1d7c-37ca-11ec-931a-fa163e99870e\/reports"}}},{"id":"8a71b7ee-3765-11ec-ad43-fa163e99870e","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"It does not mean what you think it means","description":"This isn't \"how I single-handedly rebuilt civilization after the zombie apocalyse\". If you are looking for that game, this is not it.\n\nThe premise of the game is \"this is how you died\".\n\nThe endgame is your death. This means that the game ends when you die, and you die when the game ends.\n\nThe game delivers on this premise by providing you the means to survive, until the end of the game, which is when you die.\n\nMaybe you'll die of starvation, maybe you'll die of an infection, maybe you'll die mobbed by zombies.\n\nYou won't die of old age, I can tell you that for nothing.\n\nThe game delivers exactly what it promises, and, at some point in the future, it will deliver even more.\n\nLather, rinse, repeat.\n\n\"In development\" doesn't mean \"this game isn't done, please be patient as we make it\". Not for this game, at least.\n\nFor this game, it means \"the game is pretty well done as it is, but we will keep adding stuff to it, because more stuff means more fun, and fun is fun\".\n\nThis game will never be finished.\n\nThis is fine. \n\nThe game is done*. \n\nCome back in ten years, and it will be done* better. \n\nCome back in 20, and it will be done* even better, assuming the devs don't catch the zombie plague or something.\n\nThat is okay. A game doesn't need a \"done\" tag to be worth the price.\n\nThis isn't a movie, or a book, where \"not done\" means that the end is missing or something.\n\nThe only way this game could ever truly disappoint me is by, at some point, declaring \"release\" and putting a \"done\" tag on it just for the sake of selling more copies. \n\nAs long as it stays \"in development\", I will call my purchase money well spent.\n\nBecause it was money well spent.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988190935463235","username":"Asterix101","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b