ps:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/efc780a273eff0c808dc7692ed2049e0f456a167af84e40426480e9bd6edceea_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":110,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":4,"upvotes":5},"date":"2021-08-08T07:48:30+03:00","creationDate":"2021-08-08T07:47:24+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/b97c9834-f803-11eb-8aea-fa163e99870e\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/b97c9834-f803-11eb-8aea-fa163e99870e\/reports"}}},{"id":"0edc7504-f775-11eb-94d7-fa163e99870e","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Isometric Splendor","description":"I've owned this on Steam since the earliest builds. \n\nThere are SO many zombie games along with other mediums of entertainment.. why chose this game? I think this game gives you a sense of agency that isn't quite available in other zombie games. Yes, the game play can be slow, if you let it. Sure, there are some bugs here and there. Hey, the game may not ever be finished, lol! Look how long Terraria and Starbound were in the works!\n\nThe game offers the kind of flexibility that I always want from a PC game. You can tweak game play settings down to the audio level of individual sound effects. You can adjust zombies so they behave in a variety of ways. Currently I'm experimenting with 'Black Summer' type settings where the zombies can run. It takes some time to read through all the options for a custom sandbox but this is where the game can really take on a personality of it's own.\n\nOn the other hand, game play can be very grindy. If you've played The Long Dark, you might have an idea of what kind of inventory management you'll be doing. I think that this is actually a central part of the game, though. Once you get used to keeping a go-bag or two ready, you can start looting areas and making stashes. Regardless of how you tune the zombies, it's best to take them on one-on-one.\n\nThe modding community is superb. I believe the renewed interest in this game is pretty well founded. The developers are clearly in it for the long haul and if they stave it out for another few years, their vision could very well be realized.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46987967358487298","username":"sputnikyuri","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/85238c5442d71488fea1397151503e6ffda9cc4e82d7018bf558557f59628c80_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":76,"reviews":6}},"labels":["in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":3,"upvotes":9},"date":"2021-08-07T14:46:09+03:00","creationDate":"2021-08-07T14:46:09+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/0edc7504-f775-11eb-94d7-fa163e99870e\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/0edc7504-f775-11eb-94d7-fa163e99870e\/reports"}}},{"id":"88bf4f1a-e4a9-11eb-b7bf-fa163e9aa6fa","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Best survival game in the last 10 years","description":"I bought this game for only 10$, and I discover a masterpiece, i now have more than 50 hours in the game and I still find a lot of things to do, you can customize the zombies to make the game harder, you can add new maps, objects, cars with the mods, and it's not even the final game, the crators will add the multiplayer in 6 months (you can play in multiplayer but it's not the last version of the game), they'll add animals, a story mode, and they encourage modders to improve the game as they wish, this game is really really good, way better than a lot of AAA, if you like to survive and create your own story this game is perfect, but you have to accept your death, because it's the only end of the game, it's the story of your death, not the story of an invincible man, you're like Will Smith in I am a legend. And if you don't like the vanilla game there is thousands of mods which can make the game as you wish, it's the best time to buy the game, because a game like that should be worth at least 50$.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"54568571957568356","username":"Cais_","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/f3d51f63f3a3ac710d93263dc37481294e26e4b66e830e5a445708ae99f3af9e_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":0,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":5,"upvotes":5},"date":"2021-07-14T16:54:14+03:00","creationDate":"2021-07-14T16:43:55+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/88bf4f1a-e4a9-11eb-b7bf-fa163e9aa6fa\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/88bf4f1a-e4a9-11eb-b7bf-fa163e9aa6fa\/reports"}}},{"id":"be44dfdc-bf0c-11eb-91d5-fa163e9aa6fa","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":2},"content":{"title":"I want to play this but it's a pain","description":"tl;dr: Amazing potential for hardcore survival fans, but unpolished, empty and waiting for updates and features and a very grindy gameplay with little little reward and no room for different styles of play. \n\nThis has to be the most frustrating game I've played. Not because it outright sucks, but because it has so much potential and flexibility and I love the concept of realistic post-apocalyptic zombie survival. \n\nHowever - the game at version 40 is just so devoid of fun it's unbelievable. Over almost 30 hours and a few plays the gameplay constituted mostly of inventory management, slow, methodical and pointless stomping of zombies and struggling with the cooking interface. \n\nLevelling up skills is a slow grind even with supporting traits and books. The wide variety of tools and equipment required combined with their rarity, map size and the conservative play-style the game dictates means it can take in-game weeks for you to even start with most skills, let alone see them be of any use. \nThe lack of any story or even variety in the game means you mostly have to either focus on grinding it out to reach sustainable farming and call it a day, or have a surprise bite kill you in the process. \n\nSo I decided I suck, and went to watch other people play on Youtube... nope - same pointless grind mostly cut short by glitching stair-zombies or trying anything non-conservative or simply bad luck. \n\nFinally I was having consistent issues with lagging at even the minimal settings on my mid-range 5-year old laptop that runs much more demanding games nicely - that definitely didn't help my frustrations. ","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"50616201302382507","username":"AlarisV","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/447bca2ecb57972ae4f7287da8498a2b2a05e89e7379dc4905f5ff24b9dff1f9_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":194,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":5,"upvotes":35},"date":"2021-05-27T19:58:21+03:00","creationDate":"2021-05-27T19:58:21+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/be44dfdc-bf0c-11eb-91d5-fa163e9aa6fa\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/be44dfdc-bf0c-11eb-91d5-fa163e9aa6fa\/reports"}}},{"id":"7ef8140c-9a25-11e8-a5d4-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":2},"content":{"title":"A nice pipe-dream","description":"Gameplaywise, Zomboid is one of the best zombie survival games in the genre. It truly becomes alive in multiplayer, where the old adage of the zombie genre is true- humans are the greatest threat, not the zombies. But making allies in a zombie-eat-human world is one of the high points of the multiplayer experience, building uneasy trust with people, before pooling your resources and skills. There's a great variety of character builds, and practicing them opens more options in things like carpentry, electronics, and food prep. Time will make things harder for survivors, as the power and water will be cut off, and you're forced to scavenge further afield, or take up agriculture. There's quite a bit of mods and customization going on as well.\n\nHowever, the reason I give this two stars instead of four is simple- it is unlikely Project Zomboid will be ever finished. I've watched the development from the early days as far back as 'Til Death Us Do Part and Baldspot. That's TEN years in Alpha development. Quite 