ews note, this is an interesting zombie survival game that promises detailed, realistic survival mechanics in a classic zombie apocalypse. The problem is with that \"promises\" part. Reviews were saying exactly the same thing when I bought the game on Steam in March 2014. The list of planned features still includes things like NPCs, hunting and actually finishing the map that have been on said list since before I'd even heard of the game. The game has been in development for nearly a decade, and while it has improved somewhat over time, it still doesn't look close to finished. Yes, it's a small team making their first game, but it's also a small game with an appropriate level of graphics, sounds and so on. It's pretty clear the devs have bitten off far more than they can chew here; see also the various silly issues they've had such as getting banned from various payment systems and losing all their code becaue they didn't have any backups.\n\nBasically, if you like the game in the state it's in right now, you might enjoy yourself. If you're buying now in the hopes of seeing a finished game at some point, definitely don't hold your breath.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988712003648797","username":"Kahani","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/dc04bc12a18055a2cac55cc49badcfc43ab106c5802c71213ed1b693eb5d15b3_avl2.j