","rating":{"value":4},"content":{"title":"Great for the price and state of Dev","description":"So, before the Walking Dead tv show came out, I always wished someone would come out with a series about zombies. After that, I wished someone would come up with a cool zombie video game....well it's nice to have both wishes granted.\n\nI know development has been long but this game is very playable and enjoyable at this point (or maybe I am just really patient). There is a bunch of detail in this game. You can burn food in an oven for Petes sake! And there's good weather, bad weather, variable customization, crafting, and cars! My only hope is that they do not spend too much time to add too much stuff...\"feature creep\" right?\n\nFor those old enough..remember how we got creeped out playing Resident Evil late at night, alone in the house? This game evokes the same feelings.\n\nThe price is decent, and even though it isn't finished or perfect, I would not mind paying $20 or $25 for it. So, I think the price is good for what it is so far.\n\nTo Indie Stone: I'll give you that extra star when we get the final product, which I am sure  will be one, if not the best of the isometric\/horror\/survival games out there!","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"47918683487644691","username":"allope","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a1f42c50848f384c67ae6163b2d8de8aee65d8d0811159bbd4f060d74656616f_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":4039,"reviews":6}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":5,"upvotes":6},"date":"2018-10-09T01:27:01+03:00","creationDate":"2018-10-09T01:27:01+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/46a9a098-cb49-11e8-bde4-00163e4e60cc\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/46a9a098-cb49-11e8-bde4-00163e4e60cc\/reports"}}},{"id":"3a744f20-b2e5-11e8-87b0-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":3},"content":{"title":"Still needs work.","description":"Thank goodness this is still in development. The controls feel bulky and wont respond properly sometimes.\nThe menu system is horrible and gets in the way. When its open it covers a good part of the page and sometimes you cant close it in time because clicking on the zombie is more priority but the inventory covers up the click area so you die.\nI don't like that the graphics are in 2D even though they look 3D. When I am facing an odd angle I cannot reach or hit the target. This feels buggy. This also makes some things unreachable.\nI would like the ability to climb over stuff.\nI don't know what half of the skills are or what they can be used for. When reading the game speed should auto adjust so you dont have to change it yourself.\nAnother suggestion id putting self defence books or weapon reading material for attacking or defence.\nI like that if you are at a container with craftable materials it will give you the recipe. It's annoying when some of the things won't tell you how you can use them in game. The mechanics don't give you the ability to know what your character is able to do with items. But I dont like it when it unequips my weapon in order to do certain things.\nI have seen a vehicle blocking the only door to a house. When I try to jump onto the vehicle and go in after opening the door from the side it wont let me.\nOverall it looks promising but I almost regret buying it at this stage.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"49038188784053484","username":"cmba2","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/1c2792ca586f91b6c45cd582e6cb077f6830983f6253ae3848e0e0289fb99c8a_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":556,"reviews":6}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":3,"upvotes":11},"date":"2018-07-09T01:25:54+03:00","creationDate":"2018-07-09T01:25:54+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/3a744f20-b2e5-11e8-87b0-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/3a744f20-b2e5-11e8-87b0-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"f308ba54-b2e4-11e8-9cc1-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":3},"content":{"title":"FYI","description":"I think you can get about twenty hours of gameplay from this game without too much trouble. I own this game on steam and I enjoyed it.\n\nNow for the bad.\n- Don't expect a positive community. The mods on their website forums are petty and heavy handed. You are not allowed to discuss certain aspects of the game or to be critical of the game.\n- Don't expect this game to ever leave development. I think the Indie Stone feels very comfortable with the current status quo and sees no reason to change it.\n- You will come to realize that this game has been in development for many years, and that when your grandchildren are retiring from long and fruitful careers, the devs will finally implement NPCs.\n\n-1 for crappy forums\n-1 for no NPCs","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988024175980773","username":"ipeople","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/8fd8ebce55d2afc7d53f2457a2d0ce65b437b3b451a395ba7ff6c7f4f7b48a1d_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":69,"reviews":5}},"labels":["in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":4,"upvotes":39},"date":"2018-07-08T00:23:19+03:00","creationDate":"2018-07-08T00:23:19+03:00","