 that despite being advertised as \"in dev\", the GOG version gets no alpha branches (compared to the Steam version) and even more regular releases seem to be a long way behind the Steam version.\nThe gameplay would get a four out of five, but the lack of updates for \"in dev\" on GOG mean I can't recommend it.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46987737218179696","username":"phil523","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":199,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":21,"upvotes":61},"date":"2016-05-18T22:41:33+03:00","creationDate":"2016-05-18T22:41:33+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/58ca94b8-b1b2-11e8-9b94-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/58ca94b8-b1b2-11e8-9b94-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"bb530c08-9a35-11e8-a668-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Massig Potential!","description":"Ich habe mir dieses Spiel auf Empfehlung gekauft, obwohl ich die Grafik scheu\u00dflich fand. Und ja, das ist sie. Wenn man das Spiel nicht kennt, dann l\u00e4sst man sich davon abschrecken. Ich hatte zum Gl\u00fcck einen \u00fcberzeugenden Cousin, denn das Spiel ist unfassbar gut.\nEs macht unglaublich Spa\u00df, sich durch die Stadt zu k\u00e4mpfen, zu pl\u00fcndern, sich eine Basis aufzubauen.\nEs ist noch lange nicht fertig, keine Frage, aber es lohnt sich dennoch!\nAlles in allem sehr gelungen, kurzweilig und mitrei\u00dfend. Ich kann es nur empfehlen!","language":"de-DE"},"reviewer":{"id":"47134603168369166","username":"styxger","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/a151368b5848f75091f384a18dc38e2a7b2dd222f19aae4273130d3aee4452a7_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":164,"reviews":3}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":5,"upvotes":4},"date":"2016-04-01T16:06:13+03:00","creationDate":"2016-04-01T16:06:13+03:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/bb530c08-9a35-11e8-a668-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/bb530c08-9a35-11e8-a668-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"2c11dd6e-c585-11e8-8937-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":4},"content":{"title":"Solid game with a few flaws","description":"I've been playing this game for over a month now and have found it both very entertaining and frustrating.  It will suck you in and 8 hours later, you're still playing.  When the opening says, \"This is how you died\", they mean it.  If you are looking for a challenge, here it is.  As a fan of \"The Walking Dead\", this game captures the essence of a world in the grip of the zombie apocalypse.  You're outnumbered, food and clean water are worth more than gold and diamonds, and help is not coming.  \n     The game starts you in a random house with random items and it is up to you to either stay there and try to build it into something that can withstand the apocalypse or leave and find a better place, all houses are not equal.  The starting skill tree gives you 10 points to distribute or you can choose a predesigned skill set.  If you go over the 10 points, you must take a negative trait to balance it out to zero to begin.  You have skills you can increase such as farming, cooking, and trapping that you can boost through reading books on each skill.  Other skills such as blunt weapon, you increase by  swinging for a home run on a zombie.  Also, guns are not your friend as the noise attracts your flesh hungry neighbors.  Houses with intruder alarms aren't nice either, so run if you open a door to loot a place and the alarm goes off.  \n     The Flaws:  This is a game in development, so this stuff could change.  Cooking take too much time in the game world.  Making a sandwich should not be an hour long process in regards to the game clock.  The boredom factor for your character needs to be highly reworked.  You spend far too much time holding off boredom for no reason, even if your character is actively doing something such as building a fence or reading a skill book.  A zombie scratch seems to be 100% infection rate, instead of 25% like it is supposed to be, no matter if you have medical supplies on you.  \n     Despite these things, I highly recommend this game,","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988091469168278","username":"kubadachi","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/39f88b7915e872d5123f9d16e3393f4eb99c6ed2cd2fcd7accf0254ea095000c_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":193,"reviews":1}},"labels":["verified_owner","in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":5,"upvotes":5},"date":"2016-03-13T18:27:34+02:00","creationDate":"2016-03-13T18:27:34+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/2c11dd6e-c585-11e8-8937-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/2c11dd6e-c585-11e8-8937-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"62f56774-9a29-11e8-9e1d-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":2},"content":{"title":"Great idea, lacks purpose","description":"Good: Concept, skill leveling system\nBad: No real purpose, weird controls and menus\n\nI loved Neo Scavenger, so I decided to give Project Zomboid a try. Well, it was a disappointment.  \n\nLet's start with the positives: the idea of a sandbox world full of zombies in which you have to explore and survive as long as possible looks great. I loved the skill leveling system too (the more you use a skill, the better you get at it). This game has the potential to excel.\n\nThe game does a terrible job in providing even a bare minimum of sense of purpose. Your character is there, but if you don't spend time looking at some guide online, you'll never know you can get lost very easily (the woods!!), or that you need certain tools to do certain things. And it's very difficult\/boring to figure out by yourself: controls and menus are not particularly straightforward. Eventually I ended up doing the same basic things over and over (kill zombie, fix bat, get food...). Not very fun.\n\nI was looking for something like Terraria or Neo Scavenger, in which things are not explained at all, but there are certain leads that keep you glued to the screen while you get familiar with the mechanics of the game. I guess some people are just content to go on some online guide and figure out there, but I don't find it particularly entertaining at the beginning of the game.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"47067060967203006","username":"zio_dave","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/e380dd5e8249f4ce94a3f215ccf0d99c50bf82e19aacc8e4bc3bd02da7c7e8c6_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":126,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":12,"upvotes":21},"date":"2016-02-16T04:27:11+02:00","creationDate":"2016-02-16T04:27:11+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/62f56774-9a29-11e8-9e1d-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/62f56774-9a29-11e8-9e1d-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"23e0fc58-9a27-11e8-b571-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Try Easy first, then Survival","description":"Been playing this since it came to GOG, where I bought it on the first day.\n\nStarted in Easy mode, got killed twice and restarted, eventually started figuring out the mechanics of the game, by which time it became more of a case of settling down for a quiet farming life, huge stores of long-duration food and dealing with the odd zombie popping up once in a while (since I had cleared most zombies around my base). It was all starting to feel a bit meeuwh ...\n\nSo I started a game in Survival mode, which the game description says it's how it's supposed to be played.\n\nNow I'm scared most of the time, constantly looking behind myself when outside and fearing a zombie invasion of my base, with several close calls within 2 game days, grabbing anything I can get my hands on since there are far fewer supplies and weapons to be found in houses and really working my brain on planning how to safely explore further to find the proper weapons and tools I need as well as preparing for upcoming major game events. \n\nI love it!\n\nI strongly suggest people start in Easy Mode to get to grips with the way the game works and then move on to Survival when they're ready for the proper Zombie Apocalypse experience.\n\nIt's amazing how, for a simple looking isomeric view game, it's hugely immersive, even in Easy Mode. \n\nI'm surprise it's still in development given that it has quite a lot of depth and quite a lot of map to explore and I haven't spotted any major bugs yet. Apparently the developers have some big ideas they want to implement before they feel the game is finished.\n\nRecommended!","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46989107774699199","username":"rvinagre","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb12a0c41b6de147e8b63aac5f26adc76911_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9daa6d68f78f5480145e856dfb77fb