es":118,"reviews":3}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":13,"upvotes":7},"date":"2016-02-01T23:01:38+02:00","creationDate":"2016-02-01T23:01:38+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/d0436950-9a26-11e8-9748-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/d0436950-9a26-11e8-9748-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"21e8ce7e-c585-11e8-a722-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Closest thing to being Robert Neville","description":"Wonderful game, wonderful developers.\n\nProject Zomboid is likely the most faithful video game portrayal of Romero's Americana zombie fiction, it also shares a similar ambiance to I Am Legend, the daily routine of a seasoned survivor being not too dissimilar to that of Robert Neville.\n\nYou are pitted against hunger, thirst, mental deterioration, fear, time, exhaustion, erosion, weather and more, then along with all that the neighbours want their pound of flesh. Currently zombies are the most prevalent threat, you'll soon learn to be quiet and keep out of sight if you hope to see the next day, Project Zomboid's infected lumber around on their own until their attention is aroused by the player, other zombies or the world itself, a gun shot may fire in the distance and very quickly a herd will form, tearing and beating down everything in their path, one look at the mall and you'd think the outbreak hit on Black Friday. You can choose to play online with other people and at some point down the road we'll also be surviving alongside computer controlled survivors.\n\nThe game starts with a well fleshed out character creation system where you can choose from a large selection of perks, professions and aesthetic choices. Then YOUR story begins.\n\nWhen you first play you'll think about the immediate problems and you'll likely die reacting to them. This will happen a few times, then you start to work out how to make it a few days or a week. You're now barricading a nice little place to call your own, you have a baseball bat and enough pie and ice cream to last two weeks, you'll likely die over something silly like rushing or not sneaking into a dark room. But now it's clicked, you know how eat, sleep, drink and put a wall between you and them. Each time you go back you survive a little longer, until eventually you're planning 2-3 months ahead, you're growing tomatoes and corn out front and you have a bug out bag by the back door, just in case...","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988740128750225","username":"Dr_Krieg","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/c932ca16ab8b927d09373f016145397e00e61928662463af11babcbd6292ba8f_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":null,"reviews":1}},"labels":["verified_owner","in_development"],"votes":{"downvotes":7,"upvotes":8},"date":"2016-02-01T22:59:24+02:00","creationDate":"2016-02-01T22:59:24+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/21e8ce7e-c585-11e8-a722-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/21e8ce7e-c585-11e8-a722-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"cf06eaee-9a26-11e8-ad0b-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":3},"content":{"title":"I will back up my review.","description":"Owned this title for what seems like an  eternity, awaiting the day when it's considered complete. \n\nHm, put it like this: if ever a development team wanted you to know what each had for lunch on a Tuesday or which pyjama bottoms, and from what material, they prefer, the studio behind PZ will go all out to let you know in truly exhaustive detail (and let's not mention backing up saves). They do seem like very nice folk though -super transparency will earn them respect -but for the love of Pete, release this thing and move on to other projects please.\n\nThe gameplay is fun and has much replayability, the above taken into all consideration.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46989137301051982","username":"SeamusAndroid","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/eeff67979f682a2da62baa09c291dad33daa0d0dc5d3fa2a4e700fb47acfeab0_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":76,"reviews":46}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":8,"upvotes":9},"date":"2016-02-01T22:56:28+02:00","creationDate":"2016-02-01T22:56:28+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/cf06eaee-9a26-11e8-ad0b-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/cf06eaee-9a26-11e8-ad0b-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"a99b461a-9a26-11e8-9285-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"Stunning immersive addictive gameplay","description":"This has to be the best game I have played in years.  Yes.. years.  The game play is so incredibly immersive that many times I yell out when surprised by a zombie, scaring my spouse and pets in the house. lol \n\nGraphics are pretty decent, pixelated yet somehow very detailed.  All the buildings are different, the zombie bodies varied enough that you cant see any duplicates.  Everything in the landscape is interactable.  chop trees, raid fridges, cook food, burn down the house, climb fences, escape out a window.   The sound track is so good, music fades out and you are left with only the wind, the occasional barking dog trailing off into screams,  the lone shock of a shotgun in the distance.  It is incredibly immersive.\n\nGameplay hooks you from the beginning, at first its confusing on how to handle combat, or crafting.  It took me many game days and tries to finally finish my barricading of my fort.  Liberal use of wikis is recommended as some details are not apparent, such as handles for doors can only be gotten via destroying a door rather than scavenging.   The one thing you will not be is a Rambo warrior king in this game,  combat is risky with even the slightest scratch giving a chance to give fatal zombie virus with no cure.   even using bandages made from dead zombie clothes on a cut can impart the virus.  You end up stealthing, creeping and avoiding contact and running like hell when you do.    \n\n\nFinally finishing barricading is such an event,  celebrated with sound sleep for the 1 st time in weeks as you shelter in a safe house.    Throughout all is the game clock, ticking down to winter and the loss of power when food starts to rot rapidly and you are left with dry goods and your own wits to survive.  \n\nWhat can I say, I have been playing straight for days and havent even begun to experience the full game.   \n\nbrilliant, immersive,  terrifying at times","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988003622239522","username":"mintee","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_menu_user_av_small.jpg","menu_small_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_menu_user_av_small2.jpg","menu_big":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_menu_user_av_big.jpg","menu_big_2":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/d554c46fe833ec81e4ba8db94683155aacb3e5cc0a4e58eb0d152cfa9881d597_menu_user_av_big2.jpg"}},"counters":{"games":663,"reviews":119}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":9,"upvotes":19},"date":"2016-02-01T12:18:04+02:00","creationDate":"2016-02-01T12:18:04+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/a99b461a-9a26-11e8-9285-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/a99b461a-9a26-11e8-9285-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"674c414c-9a26-11e8-8301-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"game sux u cant win","description":"My first play through, I was looting homes in my starting neighborhood looking for canned goods when I attracted the attention of a small horde of friendly zombies by turning on the lights inside a home by flicking the switch by the door. I shut the door in a hurry but they made quick work of the windows and slimed their way in. I stabbed one in the head with a kitchen knife but it managed to scratch me on my torso and I began bleeding badly; I ran upstairs and locked myself in the bathroom fumbling around the cabinets looking for bandages and anti-septic. I did a quick but efficient job thanks to my career as a nurse, and as they broke down the bathroom door I jumped out the second floor window and ended up fracturing my left foot on landing after cutting myself on shards of glass from the window, now I was in a hurry. I limped pathetically across the rear lawn and I took cover by travelling through a small wooded area next to the property. Cover works two ways, and being so wildly panicked as I was my tunnel vision did me no favours. I died.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"48017900733204827","username":"","avatar":{"links":[]},"counters":{"games":0,"reviews":1}},"labels":["in_development","verified_owner"],"votes":{"downvotes":11,"upvotes":21},"date":"2016-01-31T07:58:23+02:00","creationDate":"2016-01-31T07:58:23+02:00","internalUpdateDate":"","_links":{"vote":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/674c414c-9a26-11e8-8301-00163e97122a\/votes"},"report":{"href":"https:\/\/reviews.gog.com\/v1\/products\/1453298883\/reviews\/674c414c-9a26-11e8-8301-00163e97122a\/reports"}}},{"id":"4679d024-9a26-11e8-8622-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5