"}}},{"id":"aa129144-9a25-11e8-99e8-00163e97122a","productId":"1453298883","rating":{"value":5},"content":{"title":"One of the Better Zombie Games","description":"I've been following Project Zomboid for a long time. I first bought it on Desura a couple of months before they went to Steam and even back then I enjoyed it immensely. The game has largely expanded in the three years since it's come to Steam and it's all the better for it. The Indie Stone is comprised of some of the hardest working people I've ever had the grace to know and I fully believe they'll deliver on the stellar experience they promised us when they first set out on their arduous journey.\n\nEven in its unfinished state, though, PZ is still one of the best games I've ever played.","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988357426671495","username":"PersonaNonGrata","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_sdk_img32.jpg","sdk_img_64":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_sdk_img64.jpg","sdk_img_184":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/9b26abeb7db5f6bdc128e6f87a4918662388e407c843dcaf57941c6f50839c54_sdk_img184.jpg","menu_small":"https:\/\