y to explain than to detail an encounter I had the other day, to wit:\nI'm walking along the main drag leading to West Point on a Multiplayer server, see another player zing-zagging through zombies with an apparent baseball bat.  So I keep walking, he's got his own issues, I tried to help him by shouting \"Over here!\" but the zombies focused on him.  Then, suddenly, the guy's hitting me with his bat (no pun ).  Luckily, I never travel to West Point without my trusty, tried and true, sawed-off shotgun ... hence, I turn and Swiss cheese his butt with three buckshot blasts.  \n\nAbout five seconds later I watch him slowly walk off and bleed out.\n\nI've been shot, stabbed, and caught on fire (once) whilst in that god-forsaken town.\n\n\nIn this game it's all about survival with a capital S.  You must collect food, farm food, build a \"Safe\" base; evade mass hordes of the undead that will migrate.  If you get shot you'll be forced to pull the bullet out, stitch\/bandage up, and press on ... until you see the how you died.  Can you survive the winter?\n\nSupport these guys, they've done an amazing job!","language":"en-US"},"reviewer":{"id":"46988948101190980","username":"MrElixer","avatar":{"links":{"gog_image_id":"4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674","small":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avs.jpg","small_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avs2.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avm.jpg","medium_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avm2.jpg","large":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avl.jpg","large_2x":"https:\/\/images.gog.com\/4878b642e5af31753f29f75a26b65c0a0743a4c07991fa147c94caf581d23674_avl2.jpg","sdk_img_32":"https:\/\/images.gog